title: 'Implement RFC-135: compressed blob prefixes'
doc:
- audience: Node Dev
  description: |-
    Implements [RFC-135](https://polkadot-fellows.github.io/RFCs/approved/0135-compressed-blob-prefixes.html):
    compressed blobs are now typed with dedicated compression prefixes.
